WEBVTT

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:33.320
It'll be visible soon... Lux's power, that is.

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:40.830
What is going on here?

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:55.380
What's Rena doing?

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:40.550
Ingrid...

00:02:36.610 --> 00:02:39.450
Now, for news about this week's
National Foundation Festival.

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:42.240
Preparation for the festival
is coming along in Asteri,

00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:44.910
where vendors received permission
to set up their stalls today.

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:48.750
Many of them already line
the streets to Nornil Square

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:50.960
and things are looking quite lively.

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:55.250
This is your worldwide weather report.

00:02:56.840 --> 00:03:00.050
And now, the weather across Enastoria.

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:03.970
The whole country has been
blessed with great weather today.

00:03:04.180 --> 00:03:06.390
Silwia: mostly sunny with some clouds.

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:08.890
Bormana: also sunny with some clouds.

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:11.060
Asteri: sunny.

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:13.560
"Sisters"

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:17.690
What's so good about it?

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:18.530
Huh?

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:22.490
Yui! I said I'd do it today, didn't I?

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:26.620
It's been a while since we've
had school, so I kind of...

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:31.330
I was all excited to do it and everything.

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:33.670
That looks delicious.

00:03:35.380 --> 00:03:36.130
Um...

00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:37.380
What?

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:42.550
I haven't made tea yet; would you
mind putting some on for me?

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:52.690
I guess I can do it.

00:03:52.890 --> 00:03:55.690
Thanks, big sis!

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:03.110
How long has it been since we went to school?

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:04.910
About a week?

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:07.620
We'll be out before noon today,
but I thought I might stay behind

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:10.500
and study for exams with Retty.

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:12.620
Retsu...

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:15.290
She's not exactly an upstanding individual.

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:17.170
Huh?

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:19.710
Your big sis is not impressed.

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:23.510
She comes and ruffles my
hair every time I see her!

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:25.800
You really want to hang out with her?

00:04:27.470 --> 00:04:29.430
Retty just likes you, Rena.

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:30.390
Still!

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:34.810
She treats me like a kid, even
though I'm the big sister here.

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:37.900
Yui! Rena! I'm coming in!

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:40.320
Good morning!

00:04:40.530 --> 00:04:41.730
Good morning, Aoi!

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:44.900
--Good morning.
--Sorry, Yui, about our plans for the afternoon;

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:48.700
everything moved back and
now we've got two hours off.

00:04:48.910 --> 00:04:49.780
Oh, really?

00:04:49.990 --> 00:04:53.660
Sorry, but that means this
is my free time! See ya!

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:58.130
All this fuss so early in the morning...

00:04:58.340 --> 00:05:00.960
Aoi is dealing with a lot, too!

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:03.800
Not as much as you, though.

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:07.300
I know! Now that I've got some
free time, let's go on a date!

00:05:07.510 --> 00:05:08.800
We can go shopping together!

00:05:09.010 --> 00:05:11.560
Oh, and visit that cafe you wanted to go to!

00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:15.480
It's okay, you're busy.
You don't have to put yourself out.

00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:19.400
But we haven't been able
to go out together lately...

00:05:19.610 --> 00:05:23.190
...and I've finally got some free time.

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:25.740
Yeah, but...

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:28.610
Is that a no?

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:32.080
I'll think about it.

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:35.120
No lies, now! Think about it, okay?

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:39.170
All right, I'll see you later!

00:05:39.380 --> 00:05:40.920
Goodbye.

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:46.420
If you decide you want to go
on the date, let me know!

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:48.760
Don't call it a date.

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:51.680
What?

00:05:51.890 --> 00:05:55.350
I was just thinking,
my ring doesn't fit anymore.

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:11.870
That's it!

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:21.830
Yui

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:30.390
"Next train - 15:03 - Torias"
"Following train - 15:15 - Scoria"

00:06:30.470 --> 00:06:32.680
I'm getting on!

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:38.730
"I just got on the train. Be there soon!"

00:07:24.650 --> 00:07:25.440
Kei...

00:07:25.650 --> 00:07:27.900
It's been a while, Rena.

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:31.200
I couldn't see you back then.
It's really been a long time.

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:32.410
Back then?

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:34.570
You don't remember?

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:38.160
Come with me, Rena.

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:46.420
The incident 12 years ago at Rimgarde...

00:07:46.630 --> 00:07:49.460
You wouldn't want to cause it here too, would you?

00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:57.430
Rena, you too have become
close to someone, haven't you?

00:07:57.640 --> 00:07:59.470
I'll be waiting.

00:08:07.690 --> 00:08:09.480
Hello, Rena?

00:08:09.690 --> 00:08:10.440
Yeah.

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:12.530
I thought you had already arrived!

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:16.410
Sorry, something came up.

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:20.490
All right. Well, let's have dinner together.

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:23.120
I made breakfast, so now it's your--

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:25.290
I don't think I can make that either.

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:28.000
I don't know when I'll be able to come back.

00:08:28.210 --> 00:08:28.710
Rena?

00:08:28.920 --> 00:08:30.800
Excuse me.

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:33.380
I was told to give this to you.

00:08:33.590 --> 00:08:35.470
What is this?

00:08:35.680 --> 00:08:38.180
It's a present from your big sis.

00:08:38.390 --> 00:08:41.060
To tell the truth, I wanted
to give it to you myself.

00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:43.310
Rena, what's wrong?

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:45.980
I'm sorry, Yui...

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:50.400
...but I'll come back. You can count on it.

00:08:50.610 --> 00:08:53.990
Yui, wait for me, okay?

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:57.490
Big sis...

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:05.710
Where is Kei?

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:10.420
I am her messenger. I've been
ordered to bring you in.

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:14.760
I'm afraid you'll have to come with me.

00:09:14.970 --> 00:09:16.930
Fine, lead the way.

00:09:17.140 --> 00:09:18.430
Huh?

00:09:21.930 --> 00:09:25.100
I see. I appreciate your compliance.

00:09:25.310 --> 00:09:28.150
But I'm afraid it won't do.

00:09:30.150 --> 00:09:32.110
The thing is...

00:09:32.320 --> 00:09:34.690
...I came here to fight you!

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:26.330
You have one too, don't you?

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:30.210
Me and my Regalia Gear want a fight!

00:10:30.420 --> 00:10:31.420
What are you talking about?

00:10:31.630 --> 00:10:32.920
Psh!

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:51.310
Bring it out!

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:55.440
You're not a human, are you?

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:07.120
Heh! Now you're ready, huh?

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:12.630
I'm dying to see how powerful this thing is!

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:16.500
If you're not gonna bring
it out, that's fine with me!

00:11:18.840 --> 00:11:21.300
I'll just start things off without you!

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:38.030
Rena?

00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:43.950
There are people here.

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:47.580
If we go somewhere else, I'll do as you say.

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:50.250
People? You think I care?

00:11:50.460 --> 00:11:54.960
I don't mind if I kill every last person in this city.

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:08.180
Eternal executor, knowing
darkness, destroying darkness.

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:16.810
I summon you to the endless
destruction within me.

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:22.490
Fill me with unwavering fury.

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:24.530
Unfathomable sacred relics...

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:33.330
...in the name of Erinius, reveal yourself!

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:51.640
Magna Alecto.

00:13:01.820 --> 00:13:04.650
That's more like it!

00:13:06.360 --> 00:13:10.860
Goodbye, Yui. I love you.

00:13:58.170 --> 00:13:59.210
Rena!

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:17.600
Rena! Rena!

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:25.360
Damn! What a letdown!

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:31.370
Who the hell are you?

00:14:35.160 --> 00:14:37.250
Stop this fight, right now!

00:14:37.460 --> 00:14:41.000
Disarm yourself and accept due punishment!

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:44.420
What the hell are you blabbering about?

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:48.130
Yuinshiel Asteria.

00:14:48.340 --> 00:14:51.220
This country, the Enastorian Empire,

00:14:51.430 --> 00:14:53.850
will absolutely not tolerate people like you!

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:56.890
This country won't tolerate me?

00:14:57.100 --> 00:14:59.520
That's a good one!

00:15:03.770 --> 00:15:07.570
Well, I don't give a damn about your country!

00:15:07.780 --> 00:15:08.320
Yui!

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:10.660
If you don't run, you're dead!

00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:16.660
Yui... Yui...

00:15:18.370 --> 00:15:20.250
Why are you so reckless?

00:15:20.460 --> 00:15:22.620
What'll happen if you get hurt?

00:15:22.830 --> 00:15:23.790
It's because you...

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:28.170
Because you... My big sis said she
didn't know when she'd return.

00:15:28.380 --> 00:15:30.090
I'm sorry.

00:15:30.300 --> 00:15:33.680
I can't stay with you anymore.

00:15:34.890 --> 00:15:37.640
Is this why?

00:15:37.850 --> 00:15:39.560
I'm sorry I didn't tell you.

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:43.650
I have another name: Magna Alecto.

00:15:43.860 --> 00:15:46.360
It was so long ago, I hardly remember.

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:51.070
I was chosen for this Regalia, as Alecto's core.

00:15:52.030 --> 00:15:54.450
I wanted to be with you forever...

00:15:54.660 --> 00:15:59.160
...but in the end, I'm not human!
I can't stay with you like this!

00:15:59.950 --> 00:16:01.410
Big sis!

00:16:03.120 --> 00:16:07.040
Even if we do not share the
same blood, or you aren't a human,

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:09.460
it doesn't matter.

00:16:11.470 --> 00:16:14.890
We're a family, just the two of us.

00:16:17.180 --> 00:16:20.810
I want to be your strength, big sis.

00:16:22.140 --> 00:16:23.140
<i>Okay -</i>

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:26.190
Huh?

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:44.160
Yui, it's okay.

00:16:44.370 --> 00:16:46.290
I will protect you.

00:16:52.760 --> 00:16:55.340
Yui, lend me your strength.

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:12.820
All right, let's do this!

00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:20.870
I've heard enough from you!

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:10.960
It's over.

00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:15.420
What's over? You monster!

00:18:15.630 --> 00:18:17.760
You and I, we're both monsters!

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:21.300
Let's do it until we're ground into dust!

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:23.180
You're wrong!

00:18:23.390 --> 00:18:26.100
She is not a monster!

00:18:26.310 --> 00:18:29.480
Rena is my sister!

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:44.490
In the name of Erinius,

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:46.500
Alecto will pierce through.

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:50.580
Demonic spear, blazing red, crafted by darkness.

00:18:58.920 --> 00:19:01.720
It's not over! Not yet!

00:19:01.930 --> 00:19:03.850
Crimson Raid!

00:19:32.290 --> 00:19:35.920
Two unknowns; both are unaccounted for.

00:19:37.090 --> 00:19:37.840
Just before dawn today,

00:19:38.050 --> 00:19:39.880
at around 4PM local time,
there was a large explosion

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:42.260
--Delicious!

00:19:42.260 --> 00:19:43.680
In Asteri, the capital of the Enastorian Empire.

00:19:43.890 --> 00:19:47.220
Two moving objects were spotted at the scene.

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:13.830
I thought I might never get to see you again.

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:18.550
You blew off our date,

00:20:18.750 --> 00:20:22.470
so now you've got to make up for it!

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:24.430
Oh, that's right!

00:20:24.640 --> 00:20:27.470
Can I open this?

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:28.720
<i>Okay -</i>

00:20:28.930 --> 00:20:31.060
I wonder what it is!

00:20:32.390 --> 00:20:33.730
It's...

00:20:36.770 --> 00:20:40.070
Now, we can both wear them again.

00:20:43.110 --> 00:20:44.200
Yui...

00:20:47.240 --> 00:20:50.580
Thank you, big sis!

00:20:53.620 --> 00:20:55.920
It's okay.

00:20:56.130 --> 00:20:58.130
It's going to be okay.

00:21:02.170 --> 00:21:06.010
We've already been through so much together.

00:21:06.220 --> 00:21:10.720
Stay with me, always. Okay, big sis?

00:22:43.980 --> 00:22:46.320
The conference will begin shortly.

00:22:46.530 --> 00:22:49.530
We will open with a word from the Empress.

00:22:49.740 --> 00:22:53.580
After that, we will accept your questions.

00:22:55.830 --> 00:23:00.330
Ladies and gentlemen, the Empress
of Enastoria will now enter.

00:23:00.540 --> 00:23:02.710
Please rise.

00:23:21.310 --> 00:23:23.310
"Press Conference with the Empress"

00:23:28.280 --> 00:23:31.450
We will now begin the
conference with Yuinshiel Asteria,

00:23:31.660 --> 00:23:35.410
the Empress of Enastoria.
